id: ferocious-fighter
name: Ferocious Fighter
talentCategory: miscellaneous
prerequisites: Insight Score of 6+
description: >
  Your animal instincts take over, turning you into a wild animal on the battlefield.
text: >
  Ferocious Fighter: Your animal instincts take over, turning you into a wild animal on the battlefield.
  –Prerequisites: Insight Score of 6+
  (1)-[Passive]: While in the Feral State, increase the Dice Category of your Extra Dice gained from scoring a Critical Result by 1 Category. Double this bonus if your base Tier of Power is 4+.
  (2)-[Triggered, 2/Round]: When making a Wound Roll while in the Feral State, you may increase or reduce the Natural Result by 1 after seeing the result. This can allow you to score a Critical Result or a Botch Result.
  (3)-[Triggered/Start of Turn]: Enter the Feral State until the start of your next turn.
  (4)-[1/Encounter]: While in the Feral State, you may use the Signature Technique Maneuver, ignoring the 1st effect of the Wild level of the Feral State.

---

[passive]
# (1) Feral: the Critical Extra Dice a Category up - two, at a base Tier of Power of 4+.
if (inState("feral")) {
    dice.critical.category += 1;
}
if (inState("feral") && baseTierOfPower >= 4) {
    dice.critical.category += 1;
}
# (2) A Wound Roll made Feral - an attack's, or a Power Flare's: its Natural Result 1 up or down, after the roll beside the
# Karmic Effects - twice a Round; a Critical or a Botch worked out again from it (chat.mjs nudgeOptions).
allow feral.woundNudge;
# (4) A Signature Technique used Feral: asked, once an Encounter - Wild's (1) left out for that Maneuver (ferocious-mark;
# maneuvers.mjs askFerocious).
allow ferocious.signature;

# (3) Feral till the start of your next turn - its first level, or a level higher in it already. Its Triggered/Automatic
# button, Triggered as it is gained (the user's).
[triggered/start-of-turn, startsTriggered, effect 3]
enterState(feral, 1, start-of-next-turn);
